rgin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: bold;'><span class='question-badge'>15</span> 15. What practical thing must staff do now?</p><input type='hidden' id='ans-15' value=''><div class='option-group' data-question='15'><div class='option-item' data-value='A'><span class='option-radio'></span><span class='option-text'><strong>A</strong> give details of damaged furniture</span></div><div class='option-item' data-value='B'><span class='option-radio'></span><span class='option-text'><strong>B</strong> throw away unnecessary papers</span></div><div class='option-item' data-value='C'><span class='option-radio'></span><span class='option-text'><strong>C</strong> take home personal items</span></div></div></div><div style='background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e4e7eb; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px;'><p style='margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: bold;'><span class='question-badge'>16</span> 16. Staff will need to put folders containing confidential details</p><input type='hidden' id='ans-16' value=''><div class='option-group' data-question='16'><div class='option-item' data-value='A'><span class='option-radio'></span><span class='option-text'><strong>A</strong> into packing boxes</span></div><div class='option-item' data-value='B'><span class='option-radio'></span><span class='option-text'><strong>B</strong> into grey plastic bags</span></div><div class='option-item' data-value='C'><span class='option-radio'></span><span class='option-text'><strong>C</strong> into new filing cabinets</span></div></div></div></div><div style='background-color: #f1f2f6; border-left: 5px solid #00cec9; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 20px;'><strong style='display: block; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 5px;'>Questions 17 and 18</strong><span style='font-size: 0.9rem; color: #57606f;'>Choose <strong>TWO</strong> letters, <strong>A–E</strong>. Which TWO things do people often forget when lifting heavy things?</span></div><div style='background: #ffffff; border: 1