radio'></span><span class='option-text'><strong>B</strong> She wants to give a complete talk.</span></div><div class='option-item' data-value='C'><span class='option-radio'></span><span class='option-text'><strong>C</strong> She thinks it would be too simple.</span></div></div></div><div style='background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e4e7eb; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px;'><p style='margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: bold;'><span class='question-badge'>23</span> 23. What does Ted say about Mona's topic?</p><input type='hidden' id='ans-23' value=''><div class='option-group' data-question='23'><div class='option-item' data-value='A'><span class='option-radio'></span><span class='option-text'><strong>A</strong> Very detailed</span></div><div class='option-item' data-value='B'><span class='option-radio'></span><span class='option-text'><strong>B</strong> Too old</span></div><div class='option-item' data-value='C'><span class='option-radio'></span><span class='option-text'><strong>C</strong> Too broad</span></div></div></div><div style='background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e4e7eb; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px;'><p style='margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: bold;'><span class='question-badge'>24</span> 24. What is Mona's viewpoint on computers?</p><input type='hidden' id='ans-24' value=''><div class='option-group' data-question='24'><div class='option-item' data-value='A'><span class='option-radio'></span><span class='option-text'><strong>A</strong> They have improved work efficiency.</span></div><div class='option-item' data-value='B'><span class='option-radio'></span><span class='option-text'><strong>B</strong> They have influenced traditional media.</span></div><div class='option-item' data-value='C'><span class='option-radio'></span><span class='option-text'><strong>C</strong> They have changed people's sense of style.</span></div></div></div><div style='background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e4e7eb; padding: 20px; border-radi